      "key": {
        "uuid": "731d8f34_a54fa53e",
        "filename": "networksecurity/service/src/com/android/server/net/ct/DownloadHelper.java",
        "patchSetId": 24
      },
      "lineNbr": 54,
      "author": {
        "id": 1561651
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-20T05:50:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could the download be done over MOBILE? I think you can set roaming to `false` here as well. Is that the recommended default?",
      "revId": "6333603fbd44dab2e1ef6070d8257a8802f6aa25",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a9fbf569_5371369d",
        "filename": "networksecurity/service/src/com/android/server/net/ct/DownloadHelper.java",
        "patchSetId": 24
      },
      "lineNbr": 54,
      "author": {
        "id": 1929300
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-20T12:03:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AFAIU, setting Wifi as the only network type allowed should be sufficient to forbid roaming and mobile as well ([documentation](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/app/DownloadManager.java;l\u003d713-726;drc\u003d2a21dd13be99be7c939b2c45b08656477055c562)). In any case, I added those two options explicitly, it does not hurt to have them.",
      "parentUuid": "731d8f34_a54fa53e",
